# x402 gateway env — placeholders only. NEVER put a real key in this file.
# Copy to .env (gitignored by the repo? check before committing) and fill in
# from the deployment host's secret store. Keys live only in server env.
#
# Accounts needed (all Concordium TESTNET, funded from the in-wallet faucet):
#   SERVICE_CCD_ADDRESS        — payee: receives the 1 test CCD per report.
#   CCD_FACILITATOR_ADDRESS    — sponsor: pays the ~0.01 CCD network fee per
#                                settlement and co-signs the sponsored tx.
#   CCD_FACILITATOR_PRIVATE_KEY — hex Ed25519 key for the sponsor account.
#                                Same account may also be the payee, but keep
#                                them separate so the flow is auditable.
#   CCD_PAYER_ADDRESS / CCD_PAYER_PRIVATE_KEY — only for scripts/test-buyer.ts
#                                (the demo buyer). Never needed by the gateway.

# --- gateway (required) ---
SERVICE_CCD_ADDRESS=
CCD_FACILITATOR_ADDRESS=
CCD_FACILITATOR_PRIVATE_KEY=

# --- gateway (optional) ---
# Port the gateway listens on. Default: 4021.
PORT=4021
# Path to the Python triage CLI. Default: <repo-root>/.venv/bin/issue-triage
# ISSUE_TRIAGE_BIN=
# Triage run timeout in ms (2 model calls paced >=45 s apart take ~2 min).
# Default: 600000 (10 min).
# TRIAGE_TIMEOUT_MS=600000

# --- test buyer only (scripts/test-buyer.ts) ---
# CCD_PAYER_ADDRESS=
# CCD_PAYER_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Gateway base URL for the buyer. Default: http://localhost:4021
# GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:4021
# REPO=openminion/openminion
# ISSUE=778
